:: Activity Charge Prototype [activity nobr] {"position":"2525,1800","size":"100,100"}
/* Spend an action to charge the Stage 0 prototype faster than its slow nightly recharge.
   Started from the prototype card in the sidebar (only in the bedroom and the office); $chargeReturn is where to go back to. */
<<set _gain to ($company.prototype.chargePerAction || 20)>>
<<set $company.prototype.charge to Math.min($company.prototype.maxCharge, $company.prototype.charge + _gain)>>

<<if $player.location.passage == "Company">>
	<p>I clear a corner of the desk and plug the prototype into the wall next to the laptop. A cable, a power strip and some patience. The little status light goes from red to amber.</p>
<<else>>
	<p>I dig the charger out of the nightstand drawer and plug the prototype in beside the bed. It hums, ticks a few times and settles down while it drinks power.</p>
<</if>>

<div class="navigation-link">
	<<set _back to $player.location.passage>>
	<<link "Unplug it" _back>><</link>>
</div>
<<AdvanceTime>>
